00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:44,060
it will definitely be placed in A1, A0.

215
00:06:44,060 --> 00:06:45,440
This is something we definitely need to know.

216
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,680
That's pretty much how it works.

217
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,580
At the same time,

