00:07:07,260 --> 00:07:08,380
it's actually not the same.

232
00:07:08,380 --> 00:07:09,780
Now, can we

233
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:10,700
take a quick look at it?

234
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:11,000
Let me see,

235
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,560
this one,

236
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:17,560
let's take a look,

237
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,040
can we see this piece of code?

238
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,640
Let's take a look,

239
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:23,740
say, right here,

240
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,020
you can all take a look.

241
00:07:25,020 --> 00:07:28,240
This is what we see after disassembling it back.

242
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,340
Look at this part.

