00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:56,160
It saves some registers.

258
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:56,760
And so on.

259
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:57,580
And then,

260
00:07:57,580 --> 00:08:00,380
this code also won't be generated in our own code.

261
00:08:00,380 --> 00:08:02,480
This code is also generated for us by the compiler.

