00:15:42,370 --> 00:15:43,290
and add2 is 2,

504
00:15:43,290 --> 00:15:43,650
right?

505
00:15:43,650 --> 00:15:44,810
An effect like this.

506
00:15:44,810 --> 00:15:45,390
Now, below,

507
00:15:45,390 --> 00:15:46,610
it's actually the same,

508
00:15:46,610 --> 00:15:47,650
except that here

