00:15:51,290 --> 00:15:52,390
it just follows this order.

513
00:15:52,390 --> 00:15:53,650
The first one that appears on its side,

514
00:15:53,650 --> 00:15:53,990
it uses it

515
00:15:53,990 --> 00:15:55,010
to mean 0.

516
00:15:55,010 --> 00:15:56,270
This one is 1,

517
00:15:56,270 --> 00:15:57,030
and this one is 2.

518
00:15:57,030 --> 00:15:58,670
Following this order,

519
00:15:58,670 --> 00:16:01,130
they can just be specified by default.

520
00:16:01,130 --> 00:16:02,190
So with this kind of thing,

521
00:16:02,190 --> 00:16:03,330
is a simplified form of writing.

522
00:16:03,330 --> 00:16:04,970
So once you understand

523
00:16:04,970 --> 00:16:06,750
what it actually means under the hood,

524
00:16:06,750 --> 00:16:08,610
